Trading Wiser and Momentum Analyzer are private systems. This package — its
MCP servers, agent instructions, and related files — is proprietary. No
license is granted to copy, modify, sublicense, or distribute it except by
the copyright holder.

Access is not public. Only a person who has been explicitly onboarded and
approved by the operator may use these MCP servers or agents to reach Trading
Wiser or Momentum Analyzer. Possession of this package, a wheel, or a client
config does not grant that approval.

Approved use is limited to the tools those servers expose, under the
credentials the operator issued to that person. Those credentials are personal.
They are not to be shared or committed to a repository. The installer stores
them in a secrets file in the user config directory. The MCP client config
stores only the path to that file. Sharing credentials, bypassing login, or
calling the service without approval is unauthorized.

This package does not include the Momentum Analyzer application, its database,
or any password. The MCP server only calls the HTTP API after a successful
login with credentials from that secrets file.
